[78:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'best of both worlds because Claude, it\'s great, it\'s simple, it\'s a good place for beginners to start, but it\'s also very limited. For instance, you only have access to to certain models. N8N, on the other hand, is much more powerful and much more customizable to your own'

