[86:10] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'got. So, rather than saying something like C-3PO and C-3PO and are caught in a battle on the Tantive IV, but instead of I say something like secondary characters are caught up in an epic battle that is beyond the scope of their'

