AUDIO: 'kernel of an idea already, and you may have even fleshed out that idea a bit, but before you go any further, you need to figure out what specific genre that idea best fits under. Ideally, you want to niche down as much as possible in'

[96:56] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
