VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'essentially what this does is this says you are an expert story brainstormer. It\'s your job to collaborate with the user to brainstorm all the ingredients they need for a novel. I want you to do a mix of asking questions of the user to get their thoughts and to probe for'

[100:42] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'ideas that they already had as well as to offer your own suggestions when necessary often providing multiple suggestions for the user to pick from. Now this is important because I think the a collaborative process in the brainstorming stage is absolutely'

[100:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
