[101:33] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'that. By the end of your conversation, you should know all the major details of the story, including the genre, the style and tone, the scale of the novel, who the protagonist is, a list of all characters in the novel, a list of any world-building elements needed, and notes on what the inciting incident and'

[101:46] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
