[101:59] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'create a full summary of the novel based on the conversation you\'ve had. Include at the top of the dossier a logline that encapsulates the story overall, followed by a slightly larger synopsis with more details. Then make sure to have a brief list of all the characters,'

[102:12] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
