[132:28] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'of the big misconceptions about worldbuilding is that worldbuilding is all about fantasy or science fiction. And that\'s just not true. For instance, setting and locations is an important one regardless of what genre you\'re'

[132:41] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'writing in. And a lot of people don\'t call that worldbuilding at that point, they just call it setting. But, you also need to in pretty much every genre, you also need to worry about like objects and artifacts or groups and races or'

[132:54] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
