[151:59] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'There are a lot of fears and unease around using AI to actually write the prose of the book. So, let me hopefully help with some of those fears. [music] First of all, you don\'t actually have to use AI for this step. Trust me. A lot of'

[152:11] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
