[214:50] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'details, and there\'s a content page and a pricing page. So, for the content page, you upload your manuscript here, and you can select whether you want digital rights management for that, which in most cases I select no. Then you upload the book cover that you have'

[215:03] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'for your eBook, cuz we\'re only doing the eBook right now, and you upload that file here. And then we get to the AI-generated content section. And this is where you actually disclose where whether you use AI or not. And I'

[215:15] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'strongly suggest you be honest with this section, because this not being honest is against Amazon\'s terms of services. They do not ban you for using AI. They\'re not going to penalize you for'

[215:27] [scene:talk]
