AUDIO: 'using AI, but they will penalize you for being dishonest and going against their terms of service. So, make sure to be honest in this section. So, for this, this is a a short guide that I created on the genre, and it was heavily written by AI, and then I went through, did'

[215:41] [scene:talk]
