[216:05] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'editing, or entire work with extensive editing. So, just pick whichever is most relevant, and then you can also put the tools that you used in this process. Same goes for images, you have the same options. One or few or many with minimal or no editing or extensive editing, and'

[216:19] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: '&gt;&gt; [music] &gt;&gt; you also put the tools that you used there. And you can also do this for translations. So, if you were translating a book from one language to another using AI, you\'d want to put that here as well. Or if there\'s no AI involved whatsoever, just select no.'

[216:32] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
