[217:51] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'you will have the option of KDP Select enrollment. This is how you get your book into Kindle Unlimited or KU. It\'s a free 90-day program offered to Kindle ebooks. It allows you to run discounts in promotions like Kindle Unlimited. To'

[218:04] [scene:talk]
