AUDIO: 'enter the Kindle Storyteller contest, your book needs to be enrolled in KDP Select. So, there are advantages besides just Kindle Unlimited to having your book enrolled here, and you can enroll it here at this stage if you want, but do remember that means your ebook will'

[218:17] [scene:talk]
