VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'it\'s, say, in a series. So, let\'s say you have a long series, like eight books or more. You can put your first one at $0.99, and you\'re only making $0.35 for that book for every sale, but maybe a lot of those people, you\'ll get more'

[220:11] [scene:talk]
